{"speciesId":11,"names":{"fr":"Chrysacier","es":"Metapod","en":"Metapod","ja":"トランセル"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"red","text":"This POKéMON is vulnerable to attack while its shell is soft, exposing its weak and tender body."},{"language":"en","version":"blue","text":"This POKéMON is vulnerable to attack while its shell is soft, exposing its weak and tender body."},{"language":"en","version":"yellow","text":"Hardens its shell to protect itself. However, a large impact may cause it to pop out of its shell."},{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"Inside the shell, it is soft and weak as it pre­ pares to evolve. It stays motion­ less in the shell."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"It prepares for evolution by har­ dening its shell as much as possi­ ble to protect its soft body."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"This is its pre- evolved form. At this stage, it can only harden, so it remains motionless to avoid attack."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"The shell covering this POKéMON’s body is as hard as an iron slab. METAPOD does not move very much. It stays still because it is preparing its soft innards for evolution inside the hard shell."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"The shell covering this POKéMON’s body is as hard as an iron slab. METAPOD does not move very much. It stays still because it is preparing its soft innards for evolution inside the hard shell."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"Its shell is as hard as an iron slab. A METAPOD does not move very much because it is preparing its soft innards for evolution inside the shell."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"Even though it is encased in a sturdy shell, the body inside is tender. It can’t withstand a harsh attack."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"This POKéMON is vulnerable to attack while its shell is soft, exposing its weak and tender body."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"A steel-hard shell protects its tender body. It quietly endures hardships while awaiting evolution."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"A steel-hard shell protects its tender body. It quietly endures hardships while awaiting evolution."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"A steel-hard shell protects its tender body. It quietly endures hardships while awaiting evolution."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"Inside the shell, it is soft and weak as it prepares to evolve. It stays motionless in the shell."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It prepares for evolution by hardening its shell as much as possible to protect its soft body."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Son corps frêle est protégé par sa carapace d’acier. Il encaisse les coups durs en attendant d’évoluer."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"A steel-hard shell protects its tender body. It quietly endures hardships while awaiting evolution."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Son corps frêle est protégé par sa carapace d’acier. Il encaisse les coups durs en attendant d’évoluer."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"A steel-hard shell protects its tender body. It quietly endures hardships while awaiting evolution."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"A steel-hard shell protects its tender body. It quietly endures hardships while awaiting evolution."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"A steel-hard shell protects its tender body. It quietly endures hardships while awaiting evolution."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Son corps frêle est protégé par sa carapace d’acier. Il encaisse les coups durs en attendant d’évoluer."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Su frágil cuerpo está recubierto de una coraza dura como el acero. Permanece quieto en su desarrollo."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"A steel-hard shell protects its tender body. It quietly endures hardships while awaiting evolution."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"鋼鉄のように 硬い 殻で やわらかい 中身を 守っている。 進化するまで じっと 耐えている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il est vulnérable aux attaques tant que sa carapace est molle, car il expose son corps tendre et mou."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Este Pokémon es vulnerable al ataque cuando su coraza es blanda y no lo protege del todo."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"This Pokémon is vulnerable to attack while its shell is soft, exposing its weak and tender body."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"殻が 硬くなる前に 強い 衝撃を 受けると 中身が 出てしまうので 注意。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"La carapace protégeant ce Pokémon est dure comme du métal. Chrysacier ne bouge pas beaucoup. Il reste immobile pour préparer les organes à l’intérieur de sa carapace en vue d’une évolution future."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"La capa que recubre el cuerpo de este Pokémon es tan dura como una plancha de hierro. Metapod apenas se mueve. Permanece inmóvil para que las vísceras evolucionen dentro de la coraza que le rodea."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"The shell covering this Pokémon’s body is as hard as an iron slab. Metapod does not move very much. It stays still because it is preparing its soft innards for evolution inside the hard shell."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"体の カラは 鉄板の ように 硬い。 あまり 動かないのは カラの中で 柔らかい 中身が 進化の 準備を しているからだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"La carapace protégeant ce Pokémon est dure comme du métal. Chrysacier ne bouge pas beaucoup. Il reste immobile pour préparer les organes à l’intérieur de sa carapace en vue d’une évolution future."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"La capa que recubre el cuerpo de este Pokémon es tan dura como una plancha de hierro. Metapod apenas se mueve. Permanece inmóvil para que las vísceras evolucionen dentro de la coraza que le rodea."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"The shell covering this Pokémon’s body is as hard as an iron slab. Metapod does not move very much. It stays still because it is preparing its soft innards for evolution inside the hard shell."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"体の カラは 鉄板の ように 硬い。 あまり 動かないのは カラの中で 柔らかい 中身が 進化の 準備を しているからだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Sous sa carapace, il est tout mou et tendre. Il bouge très peu afin de ne pas secouer son corps encore fragile."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"La dura capa que le recubre el cuerpo protege sus delicadas vísceras. Metapod apenas se mueve para evitar que estas se desparramen."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"Its shell is filled with its soft innards. It doesn’t move much because of the risk it might carelessly spill its innards out."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"カラの中には トロトロの 中身が 詰まっている。 ほぼ動かないのは ウッカリ 中身が こぼれないため。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Même si sa carapace est solide, elle n’est guère composée que de chitine et peut se briser aisément. Mieux vaut éviter les combats rudes."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Su coraza es muy dura, pero no deja de estar hecha de quitina, por lo que podría quebrarse. Es mejor no llevarlo en combates muy intensos."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"Its shell is hard, but it’s still just a bug shell. It’s been known to break, so intense battles with it should be avoided."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"硬いと いっても 虫の 殻。 割れてしまうことも あるので 激しい 戦いは 禁物。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Sa carapace contient un liquide gluant. Sa structure cellulaire est en cours de modification en vue de son évolution prochaine."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"El interior del caparazón es un líquido viscoso. Todas las células de su cuerpo se están regenerando en preparación para su evolución."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Its shell is filled with a thick liquid. All of the cells throughout its body are being rebuilt in preparation for evolution."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"カラの中は ドロドロの 液体。 進化に 備えて 体中の 細胞を 作りなおしている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Sa carapace est très solide et résiste sans peine aux assauts des Picassaut. Si elle bascule, par contre, son contenu s’éparpille au sol."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Su dura coraza resiste los picotazos de un Pikipek, pero, si se agita mucho, su contenido puede verterse por el suelo."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Its hard shell doesn’t crack a bit even if Pikipek pecks at it, but it will tip over, spilling out its insides."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"とても 硬いカラは ツツケラに 突かれても びくともしないが 揺れて 中身が こぼれてしまう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Il renforce sa carapace pour se protéger, mais un coup puissant peut l’en déloger."},{"language":"es","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Pese a su constante empeño por endurecer su coraza para protegerse, puede romperse si recibe un fuerte impacto y quedar expuesto."},{"language":"en","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Hardens its shell to protect itself. However, a large impact may cause it to pop out of its shell."},{"language":"ja","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"身を守るため ひたすら カラを 硬くしても 強い 衝撃を 受けると 中身が 出てしまう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"Il renforce sa carapace pour se protéger, mais un coup puissant peut l’en déloger."},{"language":"es","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"Pese a su constante empeño por endurecer su coraza para protegerse, puede romperse si recibe un fuerte impacto y quedar expuesto."},{"language":"en","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"Hardens its shell to protect itself. However, a large impact may cause it to pop out of its shell."},{"language":"ja","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"身を守るため ひたすら カラを 硬くしても 強い 衝撃を 受けると 中身が 出てしまう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"En attendant sa prochaine évolution, il ne peut que durcir sa carapace et rester immobile pour éviter de se faire attaquer."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Como en este estado solo puede endurecer su coraza, permanece inmóvil a la espera de evolucionar."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"It is waiting for the moment to evolve. At this stage, it can only harden, so it remains motionless to avoid attack."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"進化を 待っている 状態。 硬くなる ことしか できないので 襲われないよう じっとしている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Bien que son corps soit entouré d’une carapace solide, l’intérieur est si mou qu’il ne résisterait pas à une attaque violente."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Aunque cuenta con una coraza muy dura, tiene un cuerpo bastante blando. Un ataque violento puede acabar con él."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"Even though it is encased in a sturdy shell, the body inside is tender. It can’t withstand a harsh attack."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"硬い 殻に 包まれているが 中身は 軟らかいので 強い 攻撃には 耐えられない。"}],"varieties":[{"id":11,"moves":[{"name":"string-shot","learns":[[10,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"harden","learns":[[1,"level-up",1],[2,"level-up",1],[2,"level-up",7],[3,"level-up",1],[3,"level-up",7],[4,"level-up",1],[4,"level-up",7],[5,"level-up",1],[5,"level-up",7],[6,"level-up",1],[6,"level-up",7],[7,"level-up",1],[7,"level-up",7],[8,"level-up",1],[8,"level-up",7],[9,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",7],[10,"level-up",1],[10,"level-up",7],[11,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",7],[12,"level-up",1],[12,"level-up",7],[13,"level-up",1],[13,"level-up",7],[14,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",7],[15,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",7],[16,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",7],[17,"level-up",0],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",0],[18,"level-up",1],[19,"level-up",0],[19,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",0],[20,"level-up",1],[23,"level-up",0],[23,"level-up",1],[28,"level-up",1],[29,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"iron-defense","learns":[[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[2